    690  f0b7							; Was inline between VBL-tail and .Row: making it a jsr'd KernelInit
    691  f0b7							; added ~19c + an entry WSYNC to the cycle-precise VBL-tail→.Row span
    692  f0b7							; → wall 263→264 every frame. Inits live HERE (window headroom
    693  f0b7							; 1472-1076 ≈ 396c, cost ~25c) so the entry span SHRINKS vs inline.
