   1155  f1fd							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1156  f1fd							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1157  f1fd							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1158  f1fd							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1159  f1fd							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1160  f1fd							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1161  f1fd				   UpdateP0Vertical
   1162  f1fd							; --- Clear HotBump (Temp b7) — set again only if this frame bumps hot rock ---
