   1296  f29f							;     (the clamp above `jmp .Integrate`s past anything placed earlier). While
   1297  f29f							;     Hover is set, pin Y (vy=0, no fall) but let the jet ramp run; once thrust
   1298  f29f							;     can beat gravity (JetPower >= GRAVITY+1) clear it and normal physics
   1299  f29f							;     resumes (he lifts off). No Up -> hovers in place.
