   3309  fc8a							; PCH, and ReturnPad's rts popped ($00<<8|BombX)+1 = $009A -> ZP
   3310  fc8a							; executed as code -> $F008 pad -> GameStart REBOOT to title (the
   3311  fc8a							; SIM_EXIT=down f265 296-line crash frame + the title-264 family).
   3312  fc8a							; With the tail-jmp the slot count drops by one: EnterRoom's return
   3313  fc8a							; lands on $F8/$F9 (stack-only cells) on every death path.
   3314  fc8a							; The old post-code (vy/JetPower zeros + rts) was unreachable; DELETED
   3315  fc8a							; 2026-10-16 (intro music) — the $FDD8 blast-tramp pin below absorbs the
   3316  fc8a							; shift, so the twins stay put. DropArm zeroes vyLo/vyHi/PlayerYSub itself
   3317  fc8a							; (JetPower=4 stays through the drop-in flutter — identical to the .LLStay
   3318  fc8a							; path). LoseLife's `sec` still runs (DropArm's rts pops the jsr ReloadLevel
   3319  fc8a							; slot back into LoseLife).
   3320  fc8a		       4c 20 fc 	      jmp	LoadLevel
