   3633  fda3							; BuildColupF — 12-byte final COLUPF image at ColupfBuf ($E7-$F2).
   3634  fda3							;   Stripe: rows 0,2 = LevelWallColor; row 1 = LevelWallColor2.
   3635  fda3							;   Hot rows overwrite with TickCounter-bit4 pulse (COLOR_HOT_Y/R).
   3636  fda3							;   $F0-$F2 (bombs) NO LONGER overlap-saved: body writes rows 0-2 only,
   3637  fda3							;   save/restore round trip deleted (S3.0b — window audit: zero writers).
   3638  fda3							;   Bank1 clobbers $E0-$EF during HUD; VBLANK rebuilds every frame.
   3639  fda3							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3640  fda3							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3641  fda3							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   3642  fda3							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   3643  fda3							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF6 always
   3644  fda3							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   3645  fda3							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   3646  fda3							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   3647  fda3							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   3648  fda3							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
   3649  fda3							;   in S3.0b.
