   3673  fdcb							; BombEnemyBlast — bank2 entry tramp ($FDD8, lamp-safe S9 2026-10-07): the
   3674  fdcb							; BombTick `jsr` lands here (bank0), `sta $1FF8` switches to bank2, the `jmp`
   3675  fdcb							; is fetched from bank2's byte-identical mirror at this same address and
   3676  fdcb							; lands on the body at $FD87 (the lamp type-check reads enemy records that
   3677  fdcb							; live in bank2). Body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8); A = 1 kill (BombTick
   3678  fdcb							; awards +50 — pads cannot nest), 0 none. Old inline body ($F87F, 66B)
   3679  fdcb							; deleted: the region re-packs into the gap before the $FBD6 fold pin
   3680  fdcb							; (pre-pad headroom stays 1B — pins absorb upstream shrink, not the org).
   3681  fdcb							; TWIN: bank2.asm mirrors these exact 6 bytes at $FDD8 (the pad after
   3682  fdcb							; .HOVdone). The PickPlayerFrame pin that used to absorb the size is gone
   3683  fdcb							; (retired 2026-10-20); the $FC49 / $FBF8 pins bound this block today.
