   3842  fe90							; (guard: verify_build check_moth_tramp). bank0 executes `sta $1FF8`; the next
   3843  fe90							; fetch ($FEF3) comes from bank2 = `jmp MothRoutine`. Neither bank runs its
   3844  fe90							; other half: bank0 is switched away at $FEF2, bank2 is never entered here.
   3845  fe90							; The 6-byte pad is the only free hole before FoldIndirect's pinned $FEF6.
   3846  fe90							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
